# Regression test for issue #2: \x escapes must be rejected in here-docs
# rather than panicking (previously hit `unreachable!()` in
# `Parser::parse_heredoc`). Non-raw here-docs otherwise support the full
# escape repertoire of quoted strings, but \x byte escapes remain
# binary-string-only.
let s = |
  "\x01"
# error: \x escapes are only valid in binary strings
#   --> heredoc_bad_escape_byte.dol:LL:LL
#    |
# LL |   "\x01"
#    |    ^^^^
